      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built: ingest, export, audit and doctor (CLI, core library, six format adapters, registries, dataset store, four CPU checks and four embedding checks, DINOv2 and SigLIP2 embedders, HTML/JSON/SARIF reports), the load, audit and export API, settings, logging. Split, propose, review and apply are planned.",
